     cells with base336 > 0                       3790
     of those, truth EXACTLY 0 in 421-456         2359  = 62.2%
     ⇒ ⛔ ATOM-DOMINATED: the median and the regression are driven by log(eps) = -13.8, so 119.5%% is NOT a reading about the body

  2. POPULATION FIXED (1431 cells, truth > 0 in window); ONLY THE TRUTH ESTIMATOR MOVES
     truth estimator                           b         r     level   implied
     36-month window mean                 0.8774   +0.8383   +0.8832    241.9%
